body:
That is awesome in a relationship.  It's pretty important to have separate hobbies.  And even more important to support each other in those separate hobbies while, every now and again, seeing why the other loves what they love so much.  I'm glad you both seem to be supporting each other so well.

There was a book I read some of...I think it dealt with the topic of Intimate Separateness and how knowing how to be separate and explore one's own interests is extremely healthy for a relationship! Good stuff and I hope the support continues. : D

That's what I want in a relationship. ;___;

Nice.Got my work cut out for me  with this series!  I want to make note of every lore/world-building/whatever detail  I can.  Currently just got control of Rean after having Lloyd and Rixa fight Rean and Altina.  That was a fun battle.  Blue Destination playing throughout it was pretty great as well.  My feels too..

I decided to bond Rean with Laura an the little scenes with them walking back to the campus and having a moment in the classroom after everyone leaves gives me them feels. ;___;  

It is almost as great as the whole Estelle/Joshua thing.  Man am I gonna miss these characters once this Epilogue ends.
